########## crib=16 ##########
SENSITIVITY (kernel) — does the true lane survive its own garbled ciphertext?
  garbled   tol=0    tol=g    host tol=g   agree
        0   KEPT   KEPT   KEPT   yes
        1   LOST   KEPT   KEPT   yes
        2   LOST   KEPT   KEPT   yes

SPECIFICITY + CROSS-CHECK (kernel) — clean ciphertext, all 26^4 lanes.
The 26^3 slice at the true Greek position is the same population the host arm
sampled, so those survivor counts are directly comparable.
  tol   lanes surviving   26^3 slice   undecided   GPU s   settings/s   mismatches
    0                1            1           0    0.03         13.7M   0/192
    1           130787         4998           0    0.49        0.941M   0/192
    2           454052        17466           0    4.34        0.105M   0/192

Mismatches must be 0/192. The kernel is not a second opinion on the
board — it is the same board at scale, and any disagreement is a kernel bug, not a
finding. Survivor inflation is the real cost and it is measured, not assumed.
